WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
The platform investment makes useful
capabilities available to every squad.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.200
Versioned context explains
what should happen.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:11.120
Fixtures and controlled
dependencies make tests repeatable.

00:00:11.236 --> 00:00:15.040
Existing frameworks and pipelines
run approved changes,

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.920
and an evidence service
preserves the original results.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.120
AI helps prepare tests
and interpret failures.

00:00:21.193 --> 00:00:24.640
Application teams still own
payment behavior, code review

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.240
and release decisions.
The value comes from connecting

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:31.360
these capabilities into
the team's existing work.
